## Why This Is Asked
Evaluates ability to design cross‑team reliability governance that balances speed and stability, plus concrete ownership and metrics.

## Key Concepts
- Cross‑team ownership and governance
- Reliability engineering paired with feature delivery
- Dual‑track planning and capacity framing
- Incident response, telemetry, and runbooks

## Code Example
```javascript
function reliabilityScore(incidents, mttr, errorBudgetSpent, onCallFatigue) {
  const incidentRate = incidents;
  const score = 100 - (incidentRate * 0.4 + Math.min(mttr/60, 1) * 40 + errorBudgetSpent * 0.2 + onCallFatigue * 0.2);
  return Math.max(0, score);
}
```

